{"4772770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wild Climbers Peak Panic", "steam_appid": 4772770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras/acc2b3b876a01e3cd11206c7674d1b2c.poster.avif?t=1781727701\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras/acc2b3b876a01e3cd11206c7674d1b2c.webm?t=1781727701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras/acc2b3b876a01e3cd11206c7674d1b2c.mp4?t=1781727701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to the wildest race to the top! <strong>Wild Climbers: Peak Panic</strong> is a hilarious, physics-driven multiplayer party game where speed, strategy, and a little bit of luck are your best friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: Reach the highest point in the forest before the timer hits zero. The execution? Pure chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras/1c12bb86326ea7efcfe40c037aa4e9d8.avif?t=1781727701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras_big/1c12bb86326ea7efcfe40c037aa4e9d8.avif?t=1781727701 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong> Jump into fast and frantic lobbies supporting <strong>2 to 10 players</strong>. Play with your friends in private rooms or challenge climbers from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Minute Madness:</strong> No time to waste! You only have <strong>3 minutes</strong> to scale the environment, making every second and every jump count. Keep moving, or get left behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge, Dash, and Survive:</strong> The climb isn't a walk in the park. Navigate through a variety of tricky obstacles, unpredictable traps, and handy boosters. One wrong step can send you tumbling all the way down!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quirky Characters:</strong> Choose from a roster of funny and bizarre characters—from rattling skeletons to goofy zombies—and climb in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong> Fast rounds, unpredictable physics, and hilarious rivalries mean no two climbs are ever the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras/59bee46917df7a57d759fbfc7eb94553.avif?t=1781727701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras_big/59bee46917df7a57d759fbfc7eb94553.avif?t=1781727701 width=1560 height=486 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive the panic and conquer the peak? Jump in, avoid the traps, and leave your friends in the dust!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras/acc2b3b876a01e3cd11206c7674d1b2c.poster.avif?t=1781727701\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras/acc2b3b876a01e3cd11206c7674d1b2c.webm?t=1781727701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4772770/extras/acc2b3b876a01e3cd11206c7674d1b2c.mp4?t=1781727701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp